    "date": 1730179304,
    "caption": "Last chance to secure your spot! \n\n🌏 We are excited to invite you to the event “Unlocking Central Asia: Opportunities for IT Outsourcing and Startup Development,” taking place as part of TechCrunch Disrupt 2024 on Tuesday, 29 October, at the Silkroad Innovation Hub in Palo Alto. \n\nThis event is a unique opportunity to gain insights into Central Asia’s burgeoning tech ecosystem. Investors will have the chance to discover promising startups, while IT companies and business owners can explore outsourcing opportunities with companies from the region. \n\nWho should attend:\n\n🟢Investors: Explore emerging startups and investment opportunities in Central Asia’s dynamic tech ecosystem.\n🟢IT Companies and Business Owners: Discuss outsourcing collaborations and leverage cost-saving advantages with companies from the region.\n🟢Ecosystem Builders and Entrepreneurs: Learn about expansion opportunities, including tax benefits and support programs, for establishing a presence in Central Asia.\n\nThe event will feature a panel discussion, B2B meetings with IT Park Uzbekistan, Astana Hub, and various companies, followed by networking and a dinner showcasing Eastern cuisine. We look forward to your participation!\n\n📆 Date & Time: October 29, 18:30\n\nFor more details on the event and to register, please visit the link: https://lu.ma/CentralAsiaTEch",
